OL,3,GNEWSAYour guide to the Military History
OL,4,AFestival
OL,5,
OL,6,FMilitary veterans, historians and
OL,7,Fauthors are descending on Herefordshire
OL,8,Ffor a three-day festival exploring
OL,9,Fcenturies of conflict.
OL,11,FThe Hereford Military History Festival
OL,12,F2026 runs from Friday to Sunday, with
OL,13,Fmore than 50 speaker events taking
OL,14,Fplace at venues across the city.
OL,16,FTopics range from Ancient Sparta and
OL,17,Fthe Wars of the Roses, to the SAS, the
OL,18,FSecond World War and conflicts in
OL,19,FUkraine and Iran.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
